        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333075/items/ZE93P48P>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/APA18-ch6-2955>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/APA18-ch6-2968>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/APA18-ch6-3162>,
